,"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ken's classmate who is the student council vice president. Minatsu is a tomboy who is always ready to take action, especially when it has something to do with (shounen) anime or manga. She is surprisingly good in math, which Ken considers to be uncharacteristic of her. Minatsu is also very protective of her little sister Mafuyu and despises anyone who tries to hurt her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67837"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0dadda4e8280a5cc9932b93c18da6e5f11ca4524f18e31e72b977126c79396a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/02454035a32dca1d36706c685a7c3cff69690f7c74676f77043ed7129dd898ba.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"富樫 美鈴","creatorId":"vndb:s3947","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3947","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3947","name":"富樫 美鈴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22752","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67838","characterName":"紅葉 知弦","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c67838"},"originalCharacterName":"紅葉 知弦","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1122"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chizuru is the student council secretary and a mature woman who seems to spend most of her time being quite serious. Chizuru is very manipulative at times and also has a sadistic side to her. While she is identified as the cool, serious type, she can embrace her